OL,3,GNEWSAMains fix under way as outage
OL,4,Aaffects London homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes across five south
OL,7,FLondon boroughs and two Surrey boroughs
OL,8,Fshould have their water supply restored
OL,9,Fsoon following a burst water main,
OL,10,FThames Water has said.
OL,12,FThe company said its engineers were
OL,13,Fworking on a permanent repair after
OL,14,Fisolating the burst main in West
OL,15,FMolesey.
OL,17,FThames Water initially said 15,000
OL,18,Fproperties were affected in postcode
OL,19,Fareas across Kingston upon Thames,
OL,20,FMerton, Richmond upon Thames, Sutton
OL,21,Fand Wandsworth in London, as well as
OL,22,FElmbridge and Spelthorne in Surrey.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
