OL,3,GNEWSAMains fix under way as outage
OL,4,Aaffects London homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Water apologised for the outage
OL,7,Fand said some customers may still
OL,8,Fexperience low water pressure. A
OL,9,Fbottled water station is set to open
OL,10,Flater but the location has not been
OL,11,Fconfirmed yet.
